  "name": "Where the Wave Pool Was",
  "short_name": "Lakeside Parks",
  "description": "Every six or seven weeks a drone went back up over the south shore and took the same pictures from the same two spots overhead. Laid side by side, they show the shoreline coming back: a public beach where the deep end was, a boardwalk where a dock had rotted, and a meadow over the back half of the old parking lot.",
